<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BZW unit A$500m frn priced 19.75 bps over BBSW. [CORRECTED 08:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>RTRS-BZW unit A$500m frn priced 19.75 bps over BBSW. [CORRECTED 08:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects basis point margin from 19.0 to 19.75).</p>
<p>BZW Australia Ltd unit Australian Mortgage Securities Ltd (AMS) said on Thursday its A$500 million floating rate note issue had been priced at 19.75 basis points over the thirty-day bank bill swap rate (BBSW).</p>
<p>The thirty-day bank bill swap rate was set at 6.4850 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
